      "name": "Grave Pinch",
      "kind": "spell",
      "automation": "partial",
      "description": "Legendary Cantrip\n\nChoose one creature within 30 feet. The target must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it takes 1d4 Necrotic damage, and the next time it regains Hit Points before the start of your next turn, the healing is reduced by twice your Proficiency Bonus. On a successful save, it takes no damage.\n\nA Legendary Cantrip is a minor supernatural technique that can be used as a Bonus Action. You can cast only one Legendary Cantrip per turn, and you can’t cast a Legendary Cantrip on a turn in which you cast another cantrip. You use your spellcasting ability for its attack roll or saving throw DC.\n\nCantrip Upgrade. The damage increases to 2d4 at level 5, 3d4 at level 11, and 4d4 at level 17.",
